  (text "SHT45 I2C breakout" (at 50.8 50.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top))
    (uuid d25dc84f-7a5a-5913-8823-99e3565dcbea))
  (text "J1 (2.54 mm header) / J2 (JST XH 2.50 mm): 1=VCC  2=GND  3=SCL  4=SDA\nVCC = 1.08 ... 3.6 V  (NOT 5 V tolerant!)\nI2C address 0x44 (SHT45-AD1B), up to 1 MHz (Fm+)" (at 50.8 114.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 3d4ff8cf-05bb-5327-b91e-6294f9f5703d))
  (text "R1/R2: 10k pull-ups as in datasheet Fig.1 (Rp >= 390R @ VDD >= 1.62V).\nJP1 (bottom side) is bridged by default. Cut the trace between its pads\nto disconnect both pull-ups when the bus already has them." (at 50.8 127 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 23396093-b02a-517a-bb76-2698583d1d7c))
  (text "C1: 100nF placed directly at U1 VDD/VSS (datasheet Fig.1).\nU1: die pad NOT soldered and no copper under the sensor (datasheet 5.3).\nU1 sits on a narrow PCB tongue for thermal decoupling (Sensirion Design Guide ch.3)." (at 50.8 139.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 1716c9de-e167-524b-8578-8f81a89a5eb3))

  (sheet_instances
